    "question_zh": "一家零售公司需要向另一家公司（其业务伙伴）提供一系列数据文件。这些文件存储在Amazon S3存储桶中，该存储桶属于零售公司的Account A。业务伙伴公司希望其IAM用户User_DataProcessor从其自己的AWS账户（Account B）访问这些文件。两家公司必须采取哪些步骤组合才能让User_DataProcessor成功访问S3存储桶？（选择两个。）",
    "options": [
      {
        "letter": "A",
        "text": "Turn on the cross-origin resource sharing (CORS) feature for the S3 bucket in Account A.",
        "text_zh": "为Account A中的S3存储桶启用跨源资源共享（CORS）功能。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "B",
        "text": "In Account A, set the S3 bucket policy to the following:\n{\n  \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n  \"Action\": [\"s3:GetObject\", \"s3:ListBucket\"],\n  \"Resource\": \"arn:aws:s3:::AccountABucketName/*\"\n}",
        "text_zh": "在Account A中，将S3存储桶策略设置为以下内容：\n{\n  \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n  \"Action\": [\"s3:GetObject\", \"s3:ListBucket\"],\n  \"Resource\": \"arn:aws:s3:::AccountABucketName/*\"\n}"
      },
      {
        "letter": "C",
        "text": "In Account A, set the S3 bucket policy to the following:\n{\n  \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n  \"Principal\": {\"AWS\": \"arn:aws:iam::AccountB:user/User_DataProcessor\"},\n  \"Action\": [\"s3:GetObject\", \"s3:ListBucket\"],\n  \"Resource\": [\"arn:aws:s3:::AccountABucketName/*\"]\n}",
        "text_zh": "在Account A中，将S3存储桶策略设置为以下内容：\n{\n  \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n  \"Principal\": {\"AWS\": \"arn:aws:iam::AccountB:user/User_DataProcessor\"},\n  \"Action\": [\"s3:GetObject\", \"s3:ListBucket\"],\n  \"Resource\": [\"arn:aws:s3:::AccountABucketName/*\"]\n}"
      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "In Account B, set the permissions of User_DataProcessor to the following:\n{\n  \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n  \"Action\": [\"s3:GetObject\", \"s3:ListBucket\"],\n  \"Resource\": [\"arn:aws:s3:::AccountABucketName/*\"]\n}",
        "text_zh": "在Account B中，将User_DataProcessor的权限设置为以下内容：\n{\n  \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n  \"Action\": [\"s3:GetObject\", \"s3:ListBucket\"],\n  \"Resource\": [\"arn:aws:s3:::AccountABucketName/*\"]\n}"
      },
      {
        "letter": "E",
        "text": "In Account B, set the permissions of User_DataProcessor to the following:\n{\n  \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n  \"Action\": [\"s3:GetObject\"],\n  \"Resource\": [\"arn:aws:s3:::AccountABucketName/*\"]\n}",
        "text_zh": "在Account B中，将User_DataProcessor的权限设置为以下内容：\n{\n  \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n  \"Action\": [\"s3:GetObject\"],\n  \"Resource\": [\"arn:aws:s3:::AccountABucketName/*\"]\n}"
      }
    ],
