    "question": "A company is running an application in the AWS Cloud. The core business logic is running on a set of Amazon EC2 instances in an Auto Scaling group. An Application Load Balancer (ALB) distributes tra c to the EC2 instances. Amazon Route 53 record api.example.com is pointing to the ALB. The company's development team makes major updates to the business logic. The company has a rule that when changes are deployed, only 10% of customers can receive the new logic during a testing window. A customer must use the same version of the business logic during the testing window. How should the company deploy the updates to meet these requirements?",
    "question_zh": "一家公司正在AWS云端中运行应用程式。核心业务逻辑在Auto Scaling群组中的一组Amazon EC2实例上运作。 Application Load Balancer (ALB) 将流量分配到 EC2 实例。 Amazon Route 53 记录 api.example.com 指向ALB。公司开发团队对业务逻辑进行了重大更新。该公司有一条规则，即部署变更后，只有 10% 的客户可以在测试视窗期间收到新逻辑。客户在测试视窗期间必须使用相同版本的业务逻辑。公司应如何部署更新来满足这些要求？",
