    "question": "A large education company recently introduced Amazon Workspaces to provide access to internal applications across multiple universities. The company is storing user pro les on an Amazon FSx for Windows File Server le system. The le system is configured with a DNS alias and is connected to a self-managed Active Directory. As more users begin to use the Workspaces, login time increases to unacceptable levels. An investigation reveals a degradation in performance of the le system. The company created the le system on HDD storage with a throughput of 16 MBps. A solutions architect must improve the performance of the le system during a de ned maintenance window. What should the solutions architect do to meet these requirements with the LEAST administrative effort?",
    "question_zh": "一家大型教育公司最近推出了Amazon工作区，以提供对多所大学内部应用程式的存取。该公司将用户设定档储存在 Windows 档案伺服器档案系统的Amazon FSx 上。档案系统配置了DNS别名，并连接到自我管理的Active Directory。随著越来越多的使用者开始使用工作区，登入时间会增加到不可接受的程度。一项调查显示档案系统的效能下降。该公司在 HDD 储存上创建了吞吐量为 16 MBps 的档案系统。解决方案架构师必须在定义的维护时段内提高档案系统的效能。解决方案架构师应该如何做才能以最少的管理工作来满足这些要求？",
