    "question": "A company has Linux-based Amazon EC2 instances. Users must access the instances by using SSH with EC2 SSH key pairs. Each machine requires a unique EC2 key pair. The company wants to implement a key rotation policy that will, upon request, automatically rotate all the EC2 key pairs and keep the keys in a securely encrypted place. The company will accept less than 1 minute of downtime during key rotation. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
    "question_zh": "某公司拥有基于 Linux 的 Amazon EC2 实例。使用者必须使用 SSH 和 EC2 SSH 金钥对来存取实例。每台机器都需要唯一的EC2金钥对。该公司希望实施金钥轮换政策，该政策将根据请求自动轮换所有 EC2 金钥对，并将金钥保存在安全加密的地方。本公司将接受金钥轮换期间少于 1 分钟的停机时间。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
    "options": [
      {
        "letter": "A",
        "text": "Store all the keys in AWS Secrets Manager. De ne a Secrets Manager rotation schedule to invoke an AWS Lambda function to generate new key pairs. Replace public keys on EC2 instances. Update the private keys in Secrets Manager.",
        "text_zh": "将所有金钥储存在AWS Secrets Manager中。定义一个 Secrets Manager 轮换计划来呼叫 AWS Lambda 函数来产生新的金钥对。替换 EC2 实例上的公钥。更新Secrets Manager中的私钥。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "B",
        "text": "Store all the keys in Parameter Store, a capability of AWS Systems Manager, as a string. De ne a Systems Manager maintenance window to invoke an AWS Lambda function to generate new key pairs. Replace public keys on EC2 instances. Update the private keys in Parameter Store.",
        "text_zh": "将Parameter Store（AWS Systems Manager的函数）中的所有键储存为字串。定义 Systems Manager 维护视窗来呼叫 AWS Lambda 函数来产生新的金钥对。替换 EC2 实例上的公钥。更新Parameter Store中的私钥。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "C",
        "text": "Import the EC2 key pairs into AWS Key Management Service (AWS KMS). Configure automatic key rotation for these key pairs. Create an Amazon EventBridge scheduled rule to invoke an AWS Lambda function to initiate the key rotation in AWS KMS.",
        "text_zh": "将EC2金钥对导入AWS Key Management Service（AWSKMS）。为这些密钥对配置自动密钥轮换。建立 Amazon EventBridge 调度规则来呼叫 AWS Lambda 函数来启动 AWS KMS 中的金钥轮换。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "Add all the EC2 instances to Fleet Manager, a capability of AWS Systems Manager. De ne a Systems Manager maintenance window to issue a Systems Manager Run Command document to generate new key pairs and to rotate public keys to all the instances in Fleet Manager.",
        "text_zh": "将所有 EC2 实例加入到 Fleet Manager，这是 AWS Systems Manager 的功能。定义 Systems Manager 维护时段以发出 Systems Manager 执行命令文件以产生新的金钥对并将公钥轮换到 Fleet Manager 中的所有实例。"
      }
    ],
