    "question_zh": "A company has set up its entire infrastructure on AWS. The company uses Amazon EC2 instances to host its ecommerce website and uses Amazon S3 to store static data. Three engineers at the company handle the cloud administ and clo​​ion yleica the clo​​ions alters an EC2 security group configuration of another engineer and causes noncompliance issues in the environment.解决方案架构师必须建立一个系统来追踪工程师所做的更改。 The system must send alerts when the engineers make noncompliant changes to the security settings for the EC2 instances. What is the FASTEST way for the solutions architect to meet these requirements?",
