        "text": "Create an IAM role in the management account. Attach a policy that includes permissions to view the Billing and Cost Management console. Allow the nance team users to assume the role. Use AWS Cost Explorer and the Billing and Cost Management console to analyze cost.",
        "text_zh": "在管理帐户中建立IAM角色。附加包含检视计费和成本管理控制台的权限的策略。允许财务团队使用者承担该角色。使用AWS Cost Explorer 和计费和成本管理控制台来分析成本。"
