    "question": "A nancial services company runs a complex, multi-tier application on Amazon EC2 instances and AWS Lambda functions. The application stores temporary data in Amazon S3. The S3 objects are valid for only 45 minutes and are deleted after 24 hours. The company deploys each version of the application by launching an AWS CloudFormation stack. The stack creates all resources that are required to run the application. When the company deploys and validates a new application version, the company deletes the CloudFormation stack of the old version. The company recently tried to delete the CloudFormation stack of an old application version, but the operation failed. An analysis shows that CloudFormation failed to delete an existing S3 bucket. A solutions architect needs to resolve this issue without making major changes to the application's architecture. Which solution meets these requirements?",
    "question_zh": "一家金融服务公司在 Amazon EC2 实例和 AWS Lambda 函数上运行复杂的多层应用程式。应用程式将暂存资料储存在Amazon S3中。 S3物件的有效期限仅45分钟，24小时后将删除。该公司透过启动 AWS CloudFormation 堆叠来部署应用程式的每个版本。该堆叠创建运行应用程式所需的所有资源。当公司部署并验证新的应用程式版本时，公司会删除旧版的CloudFormation堆叠。该公司最近尝试删除旧应用程式版本的CloudFormation堆叠，但操作失败。分析发现CloudFormation删除已有的S3桶失败。解决方案架构师需要在不对应用程式架构进行重大变更的情况下解决此问题。哪种解决方案满足这些要求？",
