        "letter": "A",
        "text": "Setup an AWS DataSync agent to replicate the pre xed data from the source S3 bucket to the destination S3 bucket. Select to use all available bandwidth on the task, and monitor the task to ensure that itis in the TRANSFERRING status. Create an Amazon EventBridge rule to initiate an alert if this status changes.",
        "text_zh": "设定 AWS DataSync 代理，将前缀资料从来源 S3 储存桶复制到目标 S3 储存桶。选择使用任务上的所有可用频宽，并监视任务以确保其处于 TRANSFERRING 状态。建立 Amazon EventBridge 规则，以便在此状态变更时启动警报。"
