    "question": "A company used AWS CloudFormation to create all new infrastructure in its AWS member accounts. The resources rarely change and are properly sized for the expected load. The monthly AWS bill is consistent. Occasionally, a developer creates a new resource for testing and forgets to remove the resource when the test is complete. Most of these tests last a few days before the resources are no longer needed. The company wants to automate the process of nding unused resources. A solutions architect needs to design a solution that determines whether the cost in the AWS bill is increasing. The solution must help identify resources that cause an increase in cost and must automatically notify the company's operations team. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
    "question_zh": "一家公司使用 AWS CloudFormation 在其 AWS 成员帐户中建立所有新的基础设施。资源很少发生变化，大小适合预期负载。每月的AWS帐单是一致的。有时，开发人员会建立新资源进行测试，但在测试完成后忘记删除该资源。大多数测试会持续几天，然后不再需要资源。该公司希望自动化寻找未使用资源的流程。解决方案架构师需要设计一个解决方案来确定AWS帐单中的成本是否增加。此解决方案必须协助识别导致成本增加的资源，并且必须自动通知公司的营运团队。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
