    "question": "A company needs to implement disaster recovery for a critical application that runs in a single AWS Region. The application's users interact with a web frontend that is hosted on Amazon EC2 instances behind an Application Load Balancer (ALB). The application writes to an Amazon RDS for MySQL DB instance. The application also outputs processed documents that are stored in an Amazon S3 bucket. The company’s nance team directly queries the database to run reports. During busy periods, these queries consume resources and negatively affect application performance. A solutions architect must design a solution that will provide resiliency during a disaster. The solution must minimize data loss and must resolve the performance problems that result from the nance team's queries. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
    "question_zh": "某公司需要对在单一AWSRegion中运行的关键应用程式实施灾难复原。该应用程式的使用者与托管在 Application Load Balancer (ALB) 后面的 Amazon EC2 实例上的 Web 前端进行互动。应用程式写入 MySQL 资料库实例的 Amazon RDS。该应用程式还输出储存在Amazon S3储存桶中的已处理文件。该公司的财务团队直接查询资料库来运行报告。在繁忙期间，这些查询会消耗资源并对应用程式效能产生负面影响。解决方案架构师必须设计一个能够在灾难期间提供弹性的解决方案。此解决方案必须最大限度地减少资料遗失，并且必须解决财务团队查询导致的效能问题。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
