    "question": "A company is running a serverless ecommerce application on AWS. The application uses Amazon API Gateway to invoke AWS Lambda Java functions. The Lambda functions connect to an Amazon RDS for MySQL database to store data. During a recent sale event, a sudden increase in web tra c resulted in poor API performance and database connection failures. The company needs to implement a solution to minimize the latency for the Lambda functions and to support bursts in tra c. Which solution will meet these requirements with the LEAST amount of change to the application?",
    "question_zh": "一家公司正在 AWS 上运行无伺服器电子商务应用程式。应用程式使用 Amazon API Gateway 呼叫 AWS Lambda Java 函数。 Lambda 函数连接到 MySQL 资料库的 Amazon RDS 来储存资料。在最近的促销活动中，网路流量突然增加导致 API 效能不佳和资料库连线失败。该公司需要实施一种解决方案来最大限度地减少 Lambda 函数的延迟并支援流量突发。哪种解决方案能够以最少的应用程式更改来满足这些要求？",
