        "text": "Create a KMS multi-Region primary key. Use the KMS multi-Region primary key to create a KMS multi-Region replica key in each additional Region where the application is running. Update the application code to use the speci c replica key in each Region.",
        "text_zh": "建立KMS多Region主键。使用 KMS multi-Region 主键在应用程式运行的每个附加 Region 中建立一个 KMS multi-Region 副本金钥。更新应用程式程式码以使用每个Region中的特定副本金钥。"
